$8842 c ScrollRows ; Put the 20 play rows on the screen: attributes copied, scenery shifted one pixel left, changed sprite cells copied
> For each row of RowTable: the row's attributes copied from PlayAttrs to the screen (LDDR, columns 1-30); the row walked from the right by its SolidMap tags, scenery cells shifted on the screen (RowTable holds the screen pages, $40xx), other cells copied from the pixel shadow to the screen. While the map moves (ScrollHalted $7A8E = 0) the runs of scenery cells are shifted one pixel left through the unrolled chain ShiftRun; while it stands they are skipped. Sprite cells (tag 1 to $DB) are copied from the pixel shadow and DrawnMap set; untagged cells with DrawnMap 1 are cleared; every tag but $9C is cleared, $9C only when FrameCounter AND 7 = 7 ($88CD).
> Witness: L1 33972 (boss, c1, continue, ctl-if2, ctl-kempston, ctl-sinclair, deaths-l7, ending, force, gameover, hiscore, hiscore-typed, pause, restart, l1-l8).
